{"id":"0d74e4cb72d4ed4c","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-faltings-theorem.md","title":"Faltings' Finiteness Theorems","display":"thm-faltings-theorem — Faltings' Finiteness Theorems","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-faltings-theorem","aliases":["58-thm-faltings-theorem"],"display":"thm-faltings-theorem — Faltings' Finiteness Theorems","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-genus.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-faltings-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-faltings-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-faltings-theorem — Faltings' Finiteness Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" href=\"?note=bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md\">../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4b42ccbebbab8162\" href=\"?note=4b42ccbebbab8162\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-genus.md\">../batch17/58-df-genus.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> (数域)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_K=\\operatorname{Gal}(\\overline K/K)\">\\(G_K=\\operatorname{Gal}(\\overline K/K)\\)</span> (absolute Galois group)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> (abelian varieties over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> (rational prime)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_\\ell(A),T_\\ell(B)\">\\(T_\\ell(A),T_\\ell(B)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span>-adic Tate modules)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (smooth projective geometrically connected curve over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}_S\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Genus}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Genus}_S\\)</span> (genus function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b42ccbebbab8162\" href=\"?note=4b42ccbebbab8162\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-genus.md\">../batch17/58-df-genus.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Curve}_K\">\\(\\operatorname{Curve}_K\\)</span> (type predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_K\">\\(\\sim_K\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_K\">\\(\\cong_K\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-isogeny and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-isomorphism relations on abelian varieties)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}shafarevich} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(A)\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_S\\bigl(\\{[B]_{\\cong_K}:\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(B)\\land B\\sim_K A\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}shafarevich} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(A)\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_S\\bigl(\\{[B]_{\\cong_K}:\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(B)\\land B\\sim_K A\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}isogeny} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(A)\\land\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(B)\\land\\ell\\in\\mathbb P\\to\\left(\\operatorname{Hom}_K(A,B)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Z_\\ell\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbb Z_\\ell[G_K]}(T_\\ell(A),T_\\ell(B))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}isogeny} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(A)\\land\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(B)\\land\\ell\\in\\mathbb P\\to\\left(\\operatorname{Hom}_K(A,B)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Z_\\ell\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbb Z_\\ell[G_K]}(T_\\ell(A),T_\\ell(B))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}mordell} \\vdash \\operatorname{Curve}_K(X)\\land\\mathrm{Genus}_S(X)\\geq2\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_S(X(K))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}mordell} \\vdash \\operatorname{Curve}_K(X)\\land\\mathrm{Genus}_S(X)\\geq2\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_S(X(K))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Faltings (1983): proves Mordell conjecture (Falting's theorem).</li>\n<li>Uses Arakelov geometry and height functions.</li>\n<li>The middle assertion is the number-field isogeny theorem: the integral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span>-adic Hom map is an isomorphism of Galois-equivariant homomorphism modules.</li>\n<li>Lang's conjecture: varieties of general type have finite rational points.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md","status":"resolved","id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-genus.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b42ccbebbab8162","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-genus.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_S$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-genus.md","status":"resolved","id":"4b42ccbebbab8162","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Genus}_S$ (genus function, see [[../batch17/58-df-genus.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"G_K=\\operatorname{Gal}(\\overline K/K)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"T_\\ell(A),T_\\ell(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Genus}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Curve}_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_K","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}shafarevich} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(A)\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_S\\bigl(\\{[B]_{\\cong_K}:\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(B)\\land B\\sim_K A\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}isogeny} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(A)\\land\\operatorname{AbelianVariety}_K(B)\\land\\ell\\in\\mathbb P\\to\\left(\\operatorname{Hom}_K(A,B)\\otimes_{\\mathbb Z}\\mathbb Z_\\ell\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathbb Z_\\ell[G_K]}(T_\\ell(A),T_\\ell(B))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}faltings\\text{-}mordell} \\vdash \\operatorname{Curve}_K(X)\\land\\mathrm{Genus}_S(X)\\geq2\\to\\mathrm{Finite}_S(X(K))","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false}],"bytes":2011,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-faltings-theorem.md|58-thm-faltings-theorem]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","d9a25b0ac94a3598","4b42ccbebbab8162"]}